sequenceDiagram
    autonumber
    actor A as Accueil
    participant API as API Express
    participant VS as visitService
    participant DB as PostgreSQL
    participant BUS as visitEventBus
    participant C as Autres dashboards

    A->>API: GET /api/visits/register/preflight?cin=...
    API->>VS: lookupPatientForRegistration
    VS->>DB: SELECT patient + visite active
    DB-->>VS: résultat
    VS-->>A: candidats / alertes dédup

    A->>API: POST /api/visits/register
    Note over API: requireCapability('register')
    API->>VS: registerVisitTransaction
    VS->>DB: BEGIN
    VS->>DB: SELECT visite active FOR UPDATE
    alt visite active existante
        DB-->>VS: 1 ligne
        VS-->>API: conflict 409
        API-->>A: 409 déjà enregistré
    else aucune visite active
        VS->>DB: INSERT patients (si nouveau)
        VS->>DB: INSERT visits status=waiting care_stage=triage_pending
        VS->>DB: INSERT visit_events (registered)
        VS->>DB: COMMIT
        VS->>BUS: publish(registered)
        BUS-->>C: SSE visit_event
        VS-->>API: 201 visite
        API-->>A: 201 + public_code
    end
